                "html": "<h2 class=\"jf-testimonials__heading\">Loved by builders</h2><div class=\"jf-testimonials\"><blockquote class=\"jf-testimonial\"><p>\"Finally a CMS that feels modern without a React jungle on the frontend.\"</p><footer>— Alex, indie dev</footer></blockquote><blockquote class=\"jf-testimonial\"><p>\"The block builder is exactly what we needed for marketing pages.\"</p><footer>— Sam, agency lead</footer></blockquote><blockquote class=\"jf-testimonial\"><p>\"Self-hosted, multilingual, and actually pleasant to customize.\"</p><footer>— Jordan, product team</footer></blockquote></div>"
